  "decision": "NO_CHANGE",
  "workflow_yaml": null,
  "rationale": "The workflow already implements the applicable evidence-supported optimizations: dependency caching via actions/setup-node with cache: pnpm (P-LIT-GHA-CACHE), concurrency with cancel-in-progress to cancel superseded in-progress runs (P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE), and a bounded job timeout of 10 minutes (P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT). The remaining patterns do not fit: there is no matrix, so fail-fast (P-LIT-FAIL-FAST) is inapplicable; scheduled runs are not repeatedly failing, so P-LIT-FAIL-SCHEDULE is not supported; and the canary depends on external Notion data, so suppressing schedules during repository inactivity (P-LIT-IDLE-SCHEDULE) is contraindicated. No additional change preserves the intended build and test coverage without weakening the workflow.",
